TIME          ! Time [s]                                                   > 0.0
PRESSURE      ! System pressure [Pa]                                       > 300000
HIN           ! Inlet enthalpy [J/kg]                                      > 2.72E6
MFLOW         ! Mass flow rate [kg/s]                                      > 0.05
BCTYPE        ! Wall thermal boundary-condition type [-]                   > TWALLOUT
TWALL         ! Wall temperature distribution(s) [K]                       > 385 385
WMESH         ! Relative  node size distribution [m]                       > 1.5 1.5
END
